---
<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-[#1793d1]/5">
	<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8">The "Serial Fixer" Philosophy</h2>
			<p class="text-xl text-zinc-400 mb-10 leading-relaxed italic">
				"Everything that is boring and repetitive should be automated, what is fun and repetitive should not."
			</p>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-left">
				<div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-900/50">
					<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1793d1]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
						</svg>
						Driven by Challenges
					</h3>
					<p class="text-zinc-500">
						I love to fix broken things and automate boring processes. I thrive on challenges—especially the ones where others have failed—and I have a natural disdain for mindless repetition.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-900/50">
					<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#1793d1]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
						</svg>
						Bridge Builder
					</h3>
					<p class="text-zinc-500">
						With 11 years of experience, I excel at bridging the gap between complex technical systems and business strategy. I don't just write code; I design systems that improve operational efficiency.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
